{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to &quot;Card Sim: Chinese Restaurant&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, through simple and fun drag-and-drop operations, you'll combine various ingredients to create hundreds of mouthwatering traditional Chinese dishes, satisfying the diverse cravings of your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/0dcf4a5c11d4e78c6b1f0f6e0536c0b8.avif?t=1757814003\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Pepper &amp; Egg Stir-Fry to Eight-Treasure Sticky Rice Duck, from home-style stir-fries to the grand Imperial Banquet \u2013 dozens of ingredients and hundreds of recipes await your discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/4bd11e85cca6e1c0a6142a129b2036be.avif?t=1757814003\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase new items, expand and decorate your restaurant to maximize your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/ee52daae39c10df6d310dcafca386d7a.avif?t=1757814003\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the game now to explore even more interesting gameplay and mechanics.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3978850?t=1757814003","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3978850?t=1757814003","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/3c1b89d22dfd08c0a720927835dbc4e42e5c3e49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757814003","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam